{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012b.q32.material.recovered", "text": "视频“故宫”（无视频）观看视频“故宫”的片段，回答问题。32观看视频“故宫”的片段，回答问题。（1）故宫又称紫禁城，“紫”和“禁”分别代表什么?“紫禁”体现了什么?（2）谈谈你对紫禁城的建筑“源于古人聚居的居住形式”，而又超越“居民房”的理解。三、作文题。根据题意要求，回答问题。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6debe4879feabb2844d86349a52c460798ec72b92efcf0a4948abddb14383e46", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3016, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3157, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6debe4879feabb2844d86349a52c460798ec72b92efcf0a4948abddb14383e46"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012b.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2012b.q32"], "word_count": 140, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6debe4879feabb2844d86349a52c460798ec72b92efcf0a4948abddb14383e46", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3016, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3157, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2012年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6debe4879feabb2844d86349a52c460798ec72b92efcf0a4948abddb14383e46"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": 